#
# Native CPU evidence, not owned D3D12. Scalar and two-component shader
# types match R32/RG32 descriptors. Modern properties and legacy result
# uses both recover the narrow handle widths. SRV/UAV registers overlap,
# but distinct data proves namespace separation. Physical heaps follow
# space/register/namespace order, interleaving SRVs and UAVs for AOT.
# Five lanes read three complete elements after a prefix guard, then
# partial/upper indices. RG32's last element lacks Y and reads all zero.
# Lane zero also reads 0xffffffff from every input. A divergent signed
# UAV copy retains the 42 sentinels. No arithmetic alters special FP32
# bits. All inputs, complete guarded outputs and both repeats are checked.
# Shared RGB32 layouts additionally require complete 12-byte texels at
# both shader widths: a final texel with R/G but no B returns zero even
# though the requested components fit. Both use a 296-byte raw output;
# the scalar's unused tail stays 42. Distinct B values are never copied.
# SCALAR-RAISE-DAG: call { i32, i1 } @llvm.dx.resource.load.typedbuffer{{.*}}(target("dx.TypedBuffer", i32, 0, 0, 1) {{%.*}}, i32 {{.*}})
# SCALAR-RAISE-DAG: call { i32, i1 } @llvm.dx.resource.load.typedbuffer{{.*}}(target("dx.TypedBuffer", i32, 1, 0, 1) {{%.*}}, i32 {{.*}})
# SCALAR-RAISE-DAG: call { i32, i1 } @llvm.dx.resource.load.typedbuffer{{.*}}(target("dx.TypedBuffer", i32, 0, 0, 0) {{%.*}}, i32 {{.*}})
# SCALAR-RAISE-DAG: call { i32, i1 } @llvm.dx.resource.load.typedbuffer{{.*}}(target("dx.TypedBuffer", i32, 1, 0, 0) {{%.*}}, i32 {{.*}})
# SCALAR-RAISE-DAG: call { float, i1 } @llvm.dx.resource.load.typedbuffer{{.*}}(target("dx.TypedBuffer", float, 0, 0, 1) {{%.*}}, i32 {{.*}})
# SCALAR-RAISE-DAG: call { float, i1 } @llvm.dx.resource.load.typedbuffer{{.*}}(target("dx.TypedBuffer", float, 1, 0, 1) {{%.*}}, i32 {{.*}})
# TWO-RAISE-DAG: call { <2 x i32>, i1 } @llvm.dx.resource.load.typedbuffer{{.*}}(target("dx.TypedBuffer", <2 x i32>, 0, 0, 1) {{%.*}}, i32 {{.*}})
# TWO-RAISE-DAG: call { <2 x i32>, i1 } @llvm.dx.resource.load.typedbuffer{{.*}}(target("dx.TypedBuffer", <2 x i32>, 1, 0, 1) {{%.*}}, i32 {{.*}})
# TWO-RAISE-DAG: call { <2 x i32>, i1 } @llvm.dx.resource.load.typedbuffer{{.*}}(target("dx.TypedBuffer", <2 x i32>, 0, 0, 0) {{%.*}}, i32 {{.*}})
# TWO-RAISE-DAG: call { <2 x i32>, i1 } @llvm.dx.resource.load.typedbuffer{{.*}}(target("dx.TypedBuffer", <2 x i32>, 1, 0, 0) {{%.*}}, i32 {{.*}})
# TWO-RAISE-DAG: call { <2 x float>, i1 } @llvm.dx.resource.load.typedbuffer{{.*}}(target("dx.TypedBuffer", <2 x float>, 0, 0, 1) {{%.*}}, i32 {{.*}})
# TWO-RAISE-DAG: call { <2 x float>, i1 } @llvm.dx.resource.load.typedbuffer{{.*}}(target("dx.TypedBuffer", <2 x float>, 1, 0, 1) {{%.*}}, i32 {{.*}})
# RAISE-NOT: call {{.*}} @dx.op.{{(bufferLoad|rawBufferStore)}}
